sight, harbored one-sided feelings,

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.910
then learned she had a boyfriend 
before you even confessed. Again.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.910
That's basically the same
 as being rejected!

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.150
Damn it!

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.010
From now on, I'm living for a new love.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.920
First, I'll work on my appearance 
so girls will love me.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.060
So, hey.

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.460
I was referred here by the 
nearby general hospital.

