Sorry. I'm busy right now.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:32.680
Come back another day.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:33.880
It's all right.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.720
Please come in.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.470
<b>Mysterious Disease Specialist</b>

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.980
