00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:54.520
Unfortunately, yes.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:27.410
<b>Dr. Ramune
Mysterious Disease Specialist</b>

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:34.930
Katsumata Kengo, 24, male.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:35.250
<b>Episode 2 "The Chikuwa Penis"</b>

