00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:01.730
Doctor, please stop joking around.

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:04.650
What the hell is this, anyway?

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:08.470
I heard you specialize in 
these types of diseases.

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:09.960
I think they're called...

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:13.520
