specialist who cures them.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:33.910
Seems fishy.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.700
Good for you, though.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:36.400
Huh?

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:40.460
