00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:43.090
Shihoko-san wasn't wearing her ring.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.840
It looks like he chose to redeem himself.

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:51.080
Your drastic treatments 
always put me on edge,

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:53.330
but I guess everything works out in the end.

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.110
Doctor?

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.440
All right!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:00.600
That pest is out of the way!

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.840
Now it's my turn!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:09.240
<i>That had better not be why he 
chose that treatment method.</i>

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:15.290
Anyway, that's that.

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.110
Here.

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:19.410
I'm really sorry.

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:25.030
All I can do is try to redeem 
myself by apologizing.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:30.920
Hey... Do you mind if I hit you?

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:31.910
What?

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:35.000
You can't be serious!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.340
You suck!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.350
Ow.

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:47.550
It's finally over.

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:56.640
Anyway, you can have this back.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:00.980
I see.

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:05.790
Anyway, Kengo-san, your face...

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:14.380
I was just thinking about how it's 
the same as when we first met.

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:18.910
But I think you look better 
now than you did then.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:22.810
Anyway, Kengo-san.

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:28.810
Once you've finished redeeming yourself, 
come eat at the restaurant again.

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:36.800
<i>If you still believe in that 
ring finger's future...</i>

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:43.550
The future, huh?

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:53.080
For now, I'll get something to eat.

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:57.530
Hey, Kuro.

00:19:57.530 --> 00:20:00.610
We still have that chikuwa 
we made the other day.

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:01.720
What should we do?

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:06.730
Given what happened recently, I don't 
feel like eating them the way they are.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:09.100
<b>Today's Side Dish</b>

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:09.100
<b>Simple Recipes</b>

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.610
Then let's cook something.

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:13.580
This looks easy.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.970
"Grilled chikuwa with 
mayonnaise and seaweed."

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:17.600
Let's see.

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:19.980
Start by cutting the chikuwa into slices.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:22.240
Slices...

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:30.120
<i>Once the memory faded, 
we enjoyed the chikuwa.</i>

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:14.660
Hey. Hey, you.

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:16.430
What year are you in school?

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.240
Wanna have some fun with me?

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:21.970
You'll hang out with me?

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:27.460
But I've been holding 
my pee for a while now.

00:22:27.460 --> 00:22:29.990
I can't have fun like this.

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:34.200
I'll keep you hidden from view.

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:35.900
Let it out right here.

00:22:35.900 --> 00:22:38.870
Really? Thank you.

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:58.020
You're way too young to be 
hanging out with me, brat.

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:01.980
Akatsuki

00:23:00.250 --> 00:23:01.980
Hello!

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:03.980
<b>Cheap Sweets</b>

00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:16.020
Hey. Nico-nii, it's been a while.

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:23.190
Welcome, Ramu-chan.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.380
Akatsuki

00:23:25.560 --> 00:23:28.820
<i>Kuro, let me introduce you to Grandma Ayame.</i>

00:23:28.820 --> 00:23:30.980
<i>What? Isn't she a grade school student?</i>

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:31.700
<i>That's right!</i>

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:33.930
<i>She has the body of a child,
but she's an adult on the inside.</i>

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:35.510
<i>What kind of anime is this?</i>

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:37.010
<i>"Dr. Ramune -Mysterious Disease Specialist-."</i>

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:39.480
<i>Episode 3, "Mysterious Item Shop Akatsuki."</i>

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Episode 3 
